# An album on a tag with no artist: the tag shape used to be activated only by adv:artist,
# so every other tag constraint applied to nothing and adv:album 42 validated.
# expect: ex:T adv:TagShape sh:DatatypeConstraintComponent
@prefix ex:    <https://hexplain.io/test/tag-activation-invalid#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix adv: <https://hexplain.io/ns/audio#> .

ex:T adv:album 42 .
